    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A truly exceptional country home set in highly sought after Ballymoney Village, where timeless charm meets coastal living. Just a stroll from Ballymoney Beach with views toward Tara Hill. \n\nBeautifully styled and exceptionally presented, this five bedroom, four bathroom residence blends old-world country character with refined, welcoming interiors. A charming country kitchen complete with a Belfast sink forms the heart of the home. This home boasts two large and beautifully proportioned reception rooms. \n\nOutside, a delightful garden and patio accessed by double patio doors offer a sun-drenched retreat, perfect for long summer evenings. With electric gates, a substantial garage and school bus access nearby. With Gorey Town being only 10 minutes away, and South Dublin less than an hour away this home combines convenience with a peaceful coastal setting. A rare find, rich in atmosphere and beautifully liveable.\n\nIt`s rare a property like this comes to the market. Oozing with character, rich in atmosphere and warmth, this is a home that immediately feels special beautifully styled, wonderfully welcoming and full of those details that are becoming increasingly hard to find.\n"
      },
